		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ogre-sized pile of green vines with a four-eyed, Tiki-style mask for a face. Breathes a constant stream of smoke.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 38, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +6 (2d6) and blow smoke, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blow Smoke</strong>. Fills a near- sized cube extending from kapre. CON 15+ or sickened for 1 round. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Confound</strong>. Survival and bushcraft checks within distant have DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Meld</strong>. Step inside tree.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
